:: Stylesheet [stylesheet]
/*
	Global styles. Keep this file thin — if a style only applies to one
	area, put it in that area's file instead (SugarCube concatenates every
	[stylesheet]-tagged passage, so you can add more stylesheet passages
	per-area rather than fighting over this one).
*/

:root {
	--color-bg: #0e0e10;
	--color-text: #e6e6e6;
	--color-accent: #8a5cf6;
}

body {
	background-color: var(--color-bg);
}

#story {
	max-width: 700px;
}

a.link-internal {
	color: var(--color-accent);
}
